<title>UK: BPER sets $300 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>BPER sets $300 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Citibank International and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCA POPOLARE DELL'EMILIA ROMAGNA (EUROPE) INTL SA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  BANCA POPOLARE DELL'EMILIA ROMAGNA S.C.A.R.L.</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    03.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    03.JUL.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A	   ISS PRICE  99.825    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  A+	  REOFFER    99.825</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS UK/LU/IT/US</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  ITALY     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED UNDER EMTN AND EURO DEPOSITARY RECEPT</p>
<p>		PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
